"entity": {
"name": "Imerys SA",
"description": "Imerys SA engages in the exploration, mining and processing of minerals. It operates through the following business segments: Refractory, Abrasives & Construction, Performance Minerals and Solutions for Energy Transition. The Refractory, Abrasives and Construction segment focuses on serving the market on a global use. The Performance Minerals segment involves the offering of plastics, paints and coatings, filtration, ceramics, renewable energy, paper and board markets. The Solutions for Energy Transition segment focuses on materials for electric vehicle batteries, energy storage, solar, and semiconductor applications. The company was founded on April 22, 1880 and is headquartered in Paris, France.",
